SCALES FILE STRUCTURE

The SCALES.CFG file stores all quantization scales used.

Once again, these files can also be edited by the user on a computer in a simple text editor, for users not used to programming this file will look a bit criptic but remember it is important to keep it tidy with all the brackets, commas and other punctuation elements in their correct place. make sure only to change the values and everything else is kept the same way.

